# Environment Variables

Copy this file to `.env` at the root and fill in your values. Never commit `.env`.

```
# PostgreSQL connection string
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://postgres:postgres@localhost:5432/knowledge_hub

# OpenAI API key (required for embeddings + chat completions)
OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...

# Secret used to sign JWTs — use a long random string
JWT_SECRET=change-me-to-a-random-secret

# Express server port
PORT=4000

# Token expiry (ms or vercel/ms string, e.g. "24h")
JWT_EXPIRES_IN=24h
```

Client-side (in `client/.env`):

```
# Base URL of the Express API — no trailing slash
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:4000
```
